# PvP Arena Clients (Expo)

- REST is authority. `pvp.battle.changed` only schedules rehydrate. Never apply HP/XP/winner from the socket.
- One `PvpRealtimeSession` for lobby + battle; new ticket/grant after reconnect.
- Gate controls with `allowed_actions` / `can_use`. Stable Idempotency-Key for the same logical retry; on 409 rehydrate without auto-resubmit.
- AppState background/resume and back navigation must not forfeit (5B.4). Keep docks visible above the home indicator; log scrollable.
- Display server `rewards` XP only. Keep authorization intact even while `features.pvp` is false.
- Forfeit only via confirmed Alert/dialog; never from AppState background or back navigation.
- `action_deadline_at` countdown is visual only; REST adjudication is authoritative when enabled.
- WS/error states must not claim forfeit — say reconnecting and that the turn timer may continue.
